#: aboutwidget.cpp:42 main.cpp:103
msgid "KDE Control Center"
msgstr "KDE Kuntrullzentrum"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:44
msgid "Configure your desktop environment."
msgstr "Hier kannst du dien KDE instellen."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:46
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Control Center\", a central place to configure your "
"desktop environment. Select an item from the index on the left to load a "
"configuration module."
msgstr ""
"Willkamen to dat \"KDE Kuntrullzentrum\", een zentralen Oort üm dien "
"Schrievdisch intostellen. Söök'n Indrag vun de List linkerhand ut, üm dat "
"Moduul för de Instellen to laden."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:52 main.cpp:107
msgid "KDE Info Center"
msgstr "KDE-Infozentrum"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:54
msgid "Get system and desktop environment information"
msgstr ""

#: aboutwidget.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Info Center\", a central place to find information about "
"your computer system."
msgstr ""
"Willkamen to dat \"KDE Infozentrum\", een zentraal Oort för Informatschonen "
"över dien Reekner."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:60
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Help\" tab on the left to view help for the active control "
"module. Use the \"Search\" tab if you are unsure where to look for a particular "
"configuration option."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dat \"Hülp\"-Paneel links, üm Hülp för't aktive Moduul to kriegen. Dat "
"\"Söken\"-Paneel kannst du bruken, wenn du nich seker büst, in welk Moduul du'n "
"wiß Instellensoptschoon finnst."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:66
msgid "KDE version:"
msgstr "KDE-Verschoon:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:67
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Bruker:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:68
msgid "Hostname:"
msgstr "Reeknernaam:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:69
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Systeem:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:70
msgid "Release:"
msgstr "Utgaav:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:71
msgid "Machine:"
msgstr "Maschien:"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:141
msgid "<big><b>Loading...</b></big>"
msgstr "<big><b>Bün bi't Laden...</b></big>"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:208 toplevel.cpp:343
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before running the new module or discard the "
"changes?"
msgstr ""
"De Ännern in't Moduul sünd noch nich sekert worrn.\n"
"Wullt du de Ännern anwennen, ehr dat niege Moduul start warrt, oder wullt du se "
"vergeten?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:211 toplevel.cpp:346
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before exiting the Control Center or discard "
"the changes?"
msgstr ""
"De Ännern in't Moduul sünd noch nich sekert worrn.\n"
"Wullt du de Ännern anwennen, ehr dat Kuntrullzentrum tomaakt warrt, oder wullt "
"du se vergeten?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:214 toplevel.cpp:349
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Ännern nich sekert"

#: helpwidget.cpp:57
msgid ""
"<p>Use the \"Whats This\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options.</p><p>"
"To read the full manual click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De \"Wat is dat\" (Ümschalt+F1) kannst bruken, üm Hülp för utsöchte "
"Optschonen to kriegen.</p><p>Du kannst ok dat hele <a href=\"%1\">Handbook</a> "
"lesen.</p>"

#: helpwidget.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Info Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active info "
"module.<br><br>Click <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">here</a> "
"to read the general Info Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>KDE Infozentrum</h1>För dat aktive Moduul gifft dat keen Fixhülp.<br><br>"
"Du kannst aver dat <a href=\"kinfocenter/index.html\">Infozentrum-Handbook</a> "
"lesen."

#: helpwidget.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Control Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active "
"control module.<br><br>Click <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">here</a> "
"to read the general Control Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>KDE Kuntrullzentrum</h1>För dat aktive Moduul gifft dat keen Fixhülp.<br>"
"<br> Du kannst aver dat <a href=\"kcontrol/index.html\">"
"Kuntrullzentrum-Handbook</a> lesen."

#: kcrootonly.cpp:30
msgid ""
"<big>You need super user privileges to run this control module.</big><br>"
"Click on the \"Administrator Mode\" button below."
msgstr ""
"<big>Du bruukst Administratorverlööv för düt Kuntrullmoduul.</big><br>"
"Klick buten op den Knoop \"Administratorbedrief\"."

